WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.478 --> 00:00:09.939
<b>You can use ChatGPT Work directly from your phone.</b>

2
00:00:10.231 --> 00:00:11.482
<b>I use it to catch up on work,</b>

3
00:00:11.607 --> 00:00:12.984
<b>stay on top of personal stuff,</b>

4
00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:15.403
<b>and get things done before I even make it to my desk.</b>

5
00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:17.280
<b>I've been on vacation, and I want to catch up</b>

6
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.573
<b>before I get back into the office.</b>

7
00:00:18.573 --> 00:00:20.700
<b>I'm using dictation, so I can just say what I need</b>

8
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.701
<b>instead of typing it.</b>

9
00:00:22.618 --> 00:00:24.871
<b>Can you check my Slack and Gmail from the last week,</b>

10
00:00:24.871 --> 00:00:26.622
<b>let me know if anything important happened,</b>

11
00:00:26.622 --> 00:00:27.915
<b>and tell me if there's anything</b>

12
00:00:27.915 --> 00:00:29.375
<b>I need to deal with urgently?</b>

13
00:00:29.584 --> 00:00:31.961
<b>ChatGPT is reading through my email and Slack,</b>

14
00:00:31.961 --> 00:00:32.920
<b>but especially taking note</b>

15
00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.130
<b>of the channels I'm active in,</b>

16
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.465
<b>so that it can put together a full view</b>

17
00:00:35.465 --> 00:00:36.591
<b>of what happened while I was away.</b>

18
00:00:36.758 --> 00:00:38.634
<b>Now I can see what changed,</b>

19
00:00:38.843 --> 00:00:40.470
<b>which messages I actually need to answer,</b>

20
00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:41.679
<b>and what I can ignore.</b>

21
00:00:41.679 --> 00:00:43.222
<b>I don't have to spend the first half</b>

22
00:00:43.222 --> 00:00:44.223
<b>of my day catching up.</b>

23
00:00:44.223 --> 00:00:46.434
<b>And I also use ChatGPT for personal stuff.</b>

24
00:00:46.726 --> 00:00:48.353
<b>Instead of checking all my accounts myself,</b>

25
00:00:48.519 --> 00:00:49.896
<b>I can just ask it how I'm doing.</b>

26
00:00:50.396 --> 00:00:52.315
<b>Can you check my finances for the last month</b>

27
00:00:52.523 --> 00:00:54.275
<b>and let me know how my saving is going?</b>

28
00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:56.069
<b>And also let me know if there's any spending</b>

29
00:00:56.069 --> 00:00:56.861
<b>I should be aware of.</b>

30
00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.821
<b>I've already connected the Finances plugin,</b>

31
00:00:59.197 --> 00:01:00.656
<b>so it can check my accounts and credit cards</b>

32
00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:02.075
<b>without me pulling everything up myself.</b>

33
00:01:02.408 --> 00:01:04.285
<b>It only has read-only access.</b>

34
00:01:04.494 --> 00:01:06.079
<b>It can show me how my saving is going,</b>

35
00:01:06.079 --> 00:01:07.455
<b>where I'm spending the most,</b>

36
00:01:07.455 --> 00:01:09.040
<b>and whether anything looks unusual.</b>

37
00:01:09.207 --> 00:01:11.334
<b>I can also ask it to keep checking for me,</b>

38
00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:12.960
<b>so I don't have to remember to look every day.</b>

39
00:01:13.378 --> 00:01:15.088
<b>Could you do a check like this every day</b>

40
00:01:15.088 --> 00:01:16.839
<b>and let me know if anything's out of the ordinary?</b>

41
00:01:17.215 --> 00:01:19.384
<b>Most of this doesn't require my computer at all.</b>

42
00:01:19.384 --> 00:01:20.718
<b>But if I need something from a laptop,</b>

43
00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.387
<b>I can connect to it with Remote.</b>

44
00:01:22.387 --> 00:01:23.888
<b>I open Remote on my computer,</b>

45
00:01:24.055 --> 00:01:26.641
<b>scan the pairing code with the ChatGPT app on my phone,</b>

46
00:01:27.475 --> 00:01:28.559
<b>and choose my computer.</b>

47
00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.062
<b>Now I can open a task that's already running</b>

48
00:01:31.062 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>on my computer, see what it's working on,</b>

49
00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.273
<b>and tell it what to do next.</b>

50
00:01:34.273 --> 00:01:36.567
<b>It can still use the files and apps on my laptop,</b>

51
00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:38.277
<b>even though I'm checking in from my phone.</b>

52
00:01:38.277 --> 00:01:40.238
<b>My computer just needs to stay awake and online.</b>

53
00:01:40.988 --> 00:01:42.907
<b>I can leave my Mac open, or plug it in</b>

54
00:01:42.907 --> 00:01:44.867
<b>and turn on Keep this Mac awake.</b>

55
00:01:44.867 --> 00:01:46.035
<b>I can handle work stuff</b>

56
00:01:46.035 --> 00:01:47.829
<b>and personal stuff from my phone.</b>

57
00:01:47.829 --> 00:01:49.622
<b>And if I ever need something on my computer,</b>

58
00:01:49.622 --> 00:01:50.832
<b>Remote is there too.</b>

59
00:01:50.832 --> 00:01:53.418
<b>I can get caught up before I even make it to my desk.</b>

60
00:01:53.418 --> 00:01:54.730
<b>That's ChatGPT Work.</b>
